        },
        "description": "As a rookie, he was initially excited for his task of going to the lungs, only to find LDL's, Carbon Monoxide, and Pneumococcus along the way. He is dedicated to doing his part in helping the body, however is strongly disheartened by the awful work conditions and failure of the body to improve. \n\n(Source: cellsatwork.fandom.com)",
