        },
        "description": "A close friend of AA2153, they faced certain challenges together as newbies in the horrifying situation of the body they work in. Unlike his friend, he often runs away from these situations, to put his mind at ease, but is encouraged by AA2153 to work and push forward together.\n\n~!His story sadly ends when he sacrificed himself by pushing AA2153 out of stomach acid, but in turn, fell into it.!~",
